claims=[]
def e(i,ids,fact,scope,limit,implication,kind='captured_primary_fact'):
 claims.append({'evidence_id':f'EXT-E{i:02d}','source_ids':ids,'fact_or_scoped_observation':fact,'scope':scope,'limitation':limit,'implication_hypothesis':implication,'evidence_kind':kind,'source_urls':[S[s]['url'] for s in ids],'independent_need_count':False,'causal_effect_established':False})
e(1,['ES01'],'Toyota advertises a web-based fleet platform with location, geofencing, mileage and scheduled-care reminders.','Indonesia G-Fleet public programme','No authenticated fleet account, completeness, customer uptake or performance inspected.','Generic fleet monitoring and reminders are existing OEM capabilities; a new app is not automatically a differentiated job.')
e(2,['ES01'],'The Indonesian FAQ describes a one-year subscription including a device; dealer installation and model confirmation are stated.','Current undated G-Fleet page','No price or branch inventory; device warranty limited in the source to new Toyota purchases.','Hardware, commercial terms and role authority must be distinguished from a web-interface opportunity.')
e(3,['ES14'],'The Hilux Rangga indexed product footnote says G-Fleet is progressively available at selected dealers.','Search-retrieved current OEM product footnote','Direct HTTP200 route yielded only a 59-character extracted shell. Search evidence cannot prove rollout completion.','Dealer-network presence does not establish every outlet can install or support the service.','primary_search_retrieved_fact')
e(4,['ES02'],'Toyota described OtoXpert as dealer-operated, multibrand, economical light-service workshops and reported 40 locations.','4 March 2026 Toyota press release','Issuer snapshot, not a verified live branch inventory; no all-model high-voltage or B&P capability stated.','After-free-service retention can occur through a different workshop proposition; Auto2000 branch margin and ecosystem retention may diverge.')
e(5,['ES03'],'T-OPT expanded economical fast-moving parts coverage to additional passenger models and commercial Hiace/Dyna; sale channels include Part Shop Partners and OtoXpert.','21 May 2026; model-level examples, not all variants','Not a VIN-fitment catalogue, stock count or evidence of traction-battery repair capability.','Parts-choice clarity must start with real budget channels; ordinary maintenance parts are not interchangeable with battery diagnostics.')
e(6,['ES04','ES05'],'Two official Honda pages present different Mini eligibility/expiry descriptions: above 60,000km and 18 months versus above 40,000km and one year.','Search-retrieved official current/legacy public pages','Both direct queues stopped at Honda robots boundary; no current customer contract or definitive version selected.','A version/cohort conflict is an entitlement-verification question, not proof that one headline applies universally.','primary_search_retrieved_comparison')
e(7,['ES06'],'BYD Indonesia states official parts and periodic authorized service conditions and excludes damage from unauthorized modification/chargers.','Undated Indonesian warranty conditions page','Numeric coverage tabs were not present in parsed text; retain existing scoped 2024 model evidence rather than invent current dimensions.','Compatibility and authorised energy equipment can alter a warranty decision; local manual remains necessary.')
e(8,['ES07'],'BYD extended Blade Battery coverage to eight years/250,000km with 70% minimum SOH for European BEVs and Super Hybrids, including existing cars.','15 January 2026; explicitly Europe','No Indonesian applicability follows from a worldwide media hostname or newer publication date.','A fresh global comparator can be less locally valid than an older country-specific contract.')
e(9,['ES08'],'The model-year 2020 Outlander PHEV manual includes periodic engine-use and fuel replenishment cautions alongside drive-battery storage guidance.','Indonesian MMKSI owner manual, printed2-5/PDF28','Model-specific older manual, not a current Toyota PHEV schedule; no generalized numeric operating rule inferred.','PHEV ownership combines combustion and charging/storage obligations; an HEV/BEV binary loses a real job.')
e(10,['ES08'],'That manual discusses gradual drive-battery capacity loss and warns that improper disposal is hazardous.','Outlander PHEV manual, printed2-5/PDF28','Not a warranty definition, local disposal-service offer or evidence of a dealer recycling right.','Condition decline, failure, storage and end-of-life are different decisions; no recycling product inferred.')
e(11,['ES09'],'Hyundai Indonesia advertises used-car history, original parts, inspection and roadside support with two age/mileage/warranty tiers.','Undated Indonesia Promise/Approved page','Promise says all components with an asterisk; captured page does not resolve used traction-battery inclusion or exclusions.','Used-vehicle evidence and protection are existing categories, but battery scope requires the actual contract.')
e(12,['ES10'],'Toyota provides a VIN-specific recall lookup that visibly requests 17-character VIN and email.','Current public OEM lookup, no entries submitted','No VIN eligibility, completion state, identity verification or downstream branch outcome tested.','Recall lookup is existing; an unresolved completion/custody job would need a different claim from building first lookup.')
e(13,['ES11'],'The Toyota FAQ contains distinct recall campaigns involving both bZ4X and RAV4 PHEV as well as other models; instructions include dealer booking and campaign-specific repair conditions.','Multi-campaign current FAQ','Campaign counts, durations and eligibility must not be pooled; VIN-specific checks control applicability.','Safety actions cross powertrains but remain campaign-specific, separate from paid preventive maintenance.')
e(14,['ES12'],'Toyota says remaining warranty can continue for subsequent owners who provide ownership evidence to an authorized dealer and meet maintenance conditions.','Toyota public guidance 30 July 2026','Guidance is not each vehicle warranty booklet; no blanket continuation despite noncompliance asserted.','First-owner-only exclusions from rival campaigns cannot be generalized to all Toyota warranty.')
e(15,['ES12'],'Toyota distinguishes base vehicle warranty, traction/regular battery warranties, and installed replacement-part warranty; exclusions include several causes and consumables.','30 July 2026 official explanatory article','A public explainer is not individualized claim acceptance; PHEV-specific booklet not inspected.','One protection badge cannot stand for all obligations, failures or payers.')
e(16,['ES13'],'Toyota describes customer-paid services eight through eleven earning incremental six-month/10,000km warranty benefits, within stated age/mileage caps.','T-CARE XTRA explanation 3 August 2026','Does not establish that every customer or powertrain qualifies, or that paid service is customer-saving after expected cost.','Post-free-service choice is a marginal cost/protection trade-off, rather than free-care continuation.')
e(17,['ES13'],'The August2026 article names Hybrid EV and Battery EV in its Hybrid Health Check paragraph.','Official article wording, eligibility described as three years/50,000km','Does not establish an identical BEV diagnostic protocol or override the dedicated HHC terms/individual booklet.','A shared marketing label must not erase measurement and powertrain differences.')
e(18,['ES15'],'The current L100 EV page markets a commercial BEV and displays a Jabodetabek price with dealer/stock/current-price disclaimers.','Current undated commercial product page','No fleet transaction, actual duty cycle, live availability or present warranty tab tested.','BEV customer scope includes commercial users; consumer-only programmes cannot define the whole BEV market.')
e(19,['ES16'],'Mitsubishi advertised commercial L100 EV maintenance, vehicle/battery warranty and partner rental routes in its March2024 offer.','Historical offer; February-April2024 price window','Neither 2024 price nor offer is treated as an available2026 quote; fleet performance claims are issuer claims.','Commercial BEV protection/rental is not inherently excluded; verify the contract rather than assume private-use restrictions transfer across brands.')
e(20,['ES17'],'Toyota April2026 notice includes a free transmission ECU action and a renewed VIN-specific airbag invitation for listed2001-2016 models.','17 April2026 OEM notice; specified models/years/VINs','No affected-fleet completion rate, risk incidence or open-case count measured.','Older and out-of-standard-warranty vehicles can have a relevant safety job even when ordinary paid-service economics look weak.')
e(21,['ES18'],'An insurer account of Otosurvey makes SPK issuance conditional on complete evidence and a claim within coverage.','2016 historical Astra claim workflow baseline','Not proof of 2026 UI or guaranteed immediate issuance; modern baseline is also in first-wave insurer sources.','A dealer cannot make an unconditional insurer-funded repair promise merely by improving booking.')
